      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "(J Interven Cardiol 2005;18:357-360).",
        "AbstractText": "A patient underwent laser balloon angioplasty (LBA) combined with local intracoronary heparin therapy for treatment of a high grade stenosis of the mid-portion of the left anterior descending (LAD) coronary artery. Sustained patency of the LBA-treated lesion and no new coronary stenoses were found in a 10-year angiographic follow-up study."
      },
